  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Lesbians who belong to one or more of the various Indigenous peoples of Australia; do not use to refer to the Indigenous people of the Torres Strait Islands, who are considered ethnically and culturally distinct. Only use to describe people who identify as Aboriginal Australian.</subfield>
