  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Queer people who have experienced bullying due to their gender or sexual identity and may or may not have survived; follow the individual's preference for "victims" or "survivors" whenever possible.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
