  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">LGBTQ+ people who are a part of the socio-ethnic Assamese peoples, speak the Assamese language, or reside in the Indian state of Assam. Only use for people who identify as Assamese.</subfield>
