  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Leather and kink conventions typically take place annually at a hotel, resort, or other venue. They usually include parties, performances, title contests, vendors, play spaces, and classes and workshops on kink, sex, relationships, activism, and related topics.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Las convenciones de cuero y kink suelen celebrarse anualmente en un hotel, centro tur&#xED;stico u otro lugar. Suelen incluir fiestas, actuaciones, concursos de t&#xED;tulos, vendedores, espacios de juego y clases y talleres sobre kink, sexo, relaciones, activismo y temas relacionados.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The act of roleplaying as an equine, sometimes with someone acting as a trainer, handler or pet owner, for fun or erotic enjoyment.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">El acto de representar un rol como un equino, a veces con una persona que act&#xFA;a como entrenadora, cuidadora o due&#xF1;a de una mascota, por diversi&#xF3;n o disfrute er&#xF3;tico.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The act of roleplaying as an animal or animal character, sometimes with someone acting as a trainer, handler or pet owner, for fun or erotic enjoyment.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
