  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">A device designed to hold something firmly together or to otherwise fasten down on something (such as the nipples) for the purposes of gratification.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Un dispositivo dise&#xF1;ado para mantener algo firmemente unido o para sujetar algo (como los pezones) con fines de gratificaci&#xF3;n.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">A fastener usually used to hang up clothes for drying, here used as a sex toy.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Un sujetador generalmente utilizado para colgar ropa y secarla, utilizado aqu&#xED; como juguete sexual.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The position or activity of tying a person&#x2019;s wrists and ankles together behind their back.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
