  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">A variety of practices where someone in a dominant role sets rules for someone in a submissive role that they are expected to obey and the dominant administers punishments, corrections, or rewards.</subfield>
