  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Independent, small-circulation publications usually reproduced via photocopier; use for zines created by intersex people and/or focusing on intersex identity, issues, or culture.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Publicaciones independientes de peque&#xF1;a tirada generalmente reproducidas mediante fotocopiadora; util&#xED;cese para zines creadas por personas intersex y/o centradas en la identidad intersex.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Independent, small-circulation publications usually reproduced via photocopier; use for zines created by trans people and/or focusing on trans identities, issues, or culture.</subfield>
  </datafield>
