  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Independent, small-circulation publications usually reproduced via photocopier; use for zines created by aromantic people and/or focusing on aromantic identity, issues, or culture.</subfield>
  </datafield>
