  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Un subg&#xE9;nero de la ficci&#xF3;n fant&#xE1;stica que presenta criaturas m&#xE1;gicas y sobrenaturales en entornos urbanos contempor&#xE1;neos; util&#xED;cese para la fantas&#xED;a urbana centrada en personajes o temas grisrom&#xE1;nticos.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">A positive feeling connected to queer community, activism, and/or culture that counters the impact of living in a discriminatory society.  Note that queer is used as an umbrella term for the LGBTQ+ community within this phrase.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Un sentimiento positivo conectado con la comunidad, el activismo y/o la cultura queer que contrarresta el impacto de vivir en una sociedad discriminatoria. Tenga en cuenta que queer se utiliza como t&#xE9;rmino general para la comunidad LGBTQ+ dentro de esta frase.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Lesbians who are part of the BDSM scene and assume the dominant role in sexual relationships with a dominant/submissive dynamic.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Lesbianas que forman parte de la escena BDSM y asumen el rol dominante en las relaciones sexuales con una din&#xE1;mica dominante/sumisa.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">A sense of fellowship and overall unity of purpose, political interest, and/or community sympathies based on shared experiences as LGBTQ+ people.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">A sense of fellowship and overall unity of purpose, political interest, and/or community sympathies based on shared experiences as lesbians.</subfield>
