  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Bisexual people who either study or have expert knowledge in one of the fields of the physical and/or natural sciences, including but not limited to chemists, biologists, physicists, psychologists, and multidisciplinary researchers.</subfield>
